OL,3,GNEWSACharges after man hurt in
OL,4,ABirmingham flag disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged after a man
OL,7,Fwas left with a broken leg when
OL,8,Fdisorder broke out in Birmingham as a
OL,9,Fgroup attempted to attach St George's
OL,10,Fflags to lamp-posts.
OL,12,FA pedestrian, a man in his 30s, was
OL,13,Ftaken to hospital after being hit by a
OL,14,Fvan during the unrest on Mayfield Road,
OL,15,Fjust off Pershore Road, in Stirchley,
OL,16,Fon 14 May.
OL,18,FMark Keating, 49, from Tamworth has
OL,19,Fbeen charged with four counts of
OL,20,Fassault by beating, West Midlands
OL,21,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
