OL,3,GNEWSACharges after man hurt in
OL,4,ABirmingham flag disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyan Bridge, 45, from Bromsgrove,
OL,7,FWorcestershire, leader of the Raise the
OL,8,FColours campaign group, is accused of
OL,9,Ftwo counts of using threatening or
OL,10,Fabusive words or behaviour likely to
OL,11,Fcause harassment, alarm or distress.
